TRAINED WEIGHTS / 训练权重
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository does NOT ship any .pth weights (a single checkpoint is ~116 MB,
exceeding GitHub's 100 MB hard limit, and training artifacts do not belong in
version control). Weights are produced by users running train.py.

Legal status: whether trained weights constitute a "Derivative Work" of the
training code is unsettled across jurisdictions. We therefore do NOT impose a
license obligation on weights. This is an honest statement of the boundary,
not an oversight.

Academic and ethical expectation: if you publicly release weights trained with
LensKD, or report LensKD-based results in a paper, please credit this project
in your model card, the method section, or the acknowledgements. This is a
scholarly norm rather than a license term, but violations are still treated as
academic misconduct.

